WEBVTT

00:33.687 --> 00:36.962
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.437 --> 00:39.800
=Episode 5=

00:39.950 --> 00:42.512
(Your Majesty,
You Are Seizing Your Own Shop)

00:43.027 --> 00:43.787
Your Majesty,

00:44.107 --> 00:44.946
I suggest

00:45.147 --> 00:46.946
we immediately seize this shop

00:47.027 --> 00:48.467
and confiscate these gemstones

00:48.706 --> 00:51.146
until a full investigation is conducted.

00:51.466 --> 00:52.546
Why is that?

00:53.747 --> 00:55.786
The origin of these
gemstones is unknown.

00:56.306 --> 00:57.306
By right,

00:57.507 --> 01:00.147
these gemstones are
no different from currency.

01:00.266 --> 01:01.947
They should belong to the court

01:02.386 --> 01:04.066
and be presented to Your Majesty.

01:04.827 --> 01:05.507
However,

01:05.706 --> 01:08.426
they are actually selling
them privately in the market.

01:08.586 --> 01:11.066
They have no respect
for the imperial court at all.

01:11.226 --> 01:12.787
That's not right.

01:13.226 --> 01:14.386
Is that not the case?

01:14.827 --> 01:16.947
With such a large
quantity of gemstones appearing,

01:16.980 --> 01:18.627
they should be seen
as an auspicious sign

01:18.627 --> 01:20.227
and presented to His Majesty.

01:20.506 --> 01:22.867
I agree with Chancellor Zhangsun.

01:22.987 --> 01:25.987
This matter does need
to be investigated clearly.

01:26.227 --> 01:28.066
But it did indeed discourage Beicang's

01:28.066 --> 01:29.667
disloyal intentions toward our dynasty.

01:29.947 --> 01:31.227
If they trade these items

01:31.227 --> 01:33.146
for our 100,000 guan worth of grain...

01:33.146 --> 01:33.826
No matter.

01:34.027 --> 01:35.307
An investigation is fine.

01:35.587 --> 01:37.947
Find out exactly where these came from.

01:38.587 --> 01:39.587
If there are no issues,

01:39.947 --> 01:41.106
I will handsomely reward

01:41.186 --> 01:42.146
that shop owner.

01:42.947 --> 01:45.746
But to confiscate private
wealth as soon as it appears...

01:45.746 --> 01:47.346
It is only a temporary seizure.

01:47.400 --> 01:49.147
Chancellor Fang,
there is no need to worry.

01:49.906 --> 01:50.707
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:52.067 --> 01:52.867
Cheng Chuchi.

01:53.520 --> 01:54.386
Present, Your Majesty.

01:54.587 --> 01:55.746
Go and see to it.

01:55.906 --> 01:56.787
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:59.850 --> 02:02.050
(Ganlu Palace)

02:04.106 --> 02:04.667
Princess.

02:05.147 --> 02:06.626
How much longer will my father be?

02:06.707 --> 02:07.466
Well,

02:07.667 --> 02:08.626
I do not know either.

02:08.826 --> 02:09.826
Please wait a bit longer.

02:14.186 --> 02:15.320
Imperial Guards, follow me.

02:16.550 --> 02:19.737
(Ganlu Palace)

02:22.227 --> 02:22.947
Your Highness,

02:23.360 --> 02:25.546
the Empress requests your
presence at Fengluan Palace.

02:28.466 --> 02:29.746
Did she say what it's about?

02:29.746 --> 02:31.626
The Crown Prince has overspent,

02:31.626 --> 02:32.947
and the Empress is furious.

02:36.147 --> 02:36.787
Eunuch Wang,

02:37.266 --> 02:38.386
if Father calls for me,

02:38.587 --> 02:40.027
tell him I am with Mother.

02:40.546 --> 02:41.346
Yes.

02:43.537 --> 02:46.550
(Ganlu Palace)

02:46.707 --> 02:48.106
Ridiculous.

02:48.906 --> 02:49.986
As the Crown Prince,

02:50.100 --> 02:52.267
don't you know the imperial
treasury is short on funds?

02:52.707 --> 02:54.387
If the Grand Tutor hadn't told me,

02:54.800 --> 02:56.506
I wouldn't have known
you spent 5,000 guan

02:56.506 --> 02:58.027
just to buy some glaze.

02:59.107 --> 03:00.707
If your father finds out,

03:00.707 --> 03:01.867
what will he think of you?

03:04.466 --> 03:05.267
Mother,

03:05.666 --> 03:08.027
- I accidentally bought a bit too much.
- Mother.

03:08.107 --> 03:10.226
But this glazeware is beautiful.

03:10.226 --> 03:12.226
I really love it.

03:13.066 --> 03:14.260
If you don't believe me, look.

03:18.427 --> 03:19.226
See?

03:19.906 --> 03:20.946
Look at this vase.

03:20.946 --> 03:21.746
Isn't it beautiful?

03:22.506 --> 03:23.186
This...

03:25.307 --> 03:26.186
And these too.

03:32.107 --> 03:33.186
This glazed cup

03:33.427 --> 03:34.786
is as transparent as ice,

03:35.107 --> 03:36.466
with colors like glowing clouds.

03:36.906 --> 03:38.666
It captures light and shadow

03:38.946 --> 03:40.746
and holds the elegance of the world.

03:41.506 --> 03:42.827
This is stunning.

03:43.066 --> 03:44.066
Of course.

03:44.987 --> 03:47.587
In the Great Yong, there is actually
such exquisite glazeware.

03:49.867 --> 03:50.346
Oh, yes.

03:50.587 --> 03:51.707
And this cup.

03:52.066 --> 03:52.946
Look, Mother.

03:53.066 --> 03:54.186
Look at its shape.

03:54.186 --> 03:54.626
(Is this not...)

03:54.626 --> 03:55.427
I've never seen anything like it.

03:55.427 --> 03:56.547
It's crystal clear.

03:57.147 --> 03:57.946
Brother,

03:58.107 --> 03:59.147
where did you buy these?

03:59.427 --> 04:00.506
At Juxian Restaurant.

04:00.786 --> 04:01.587
- What?
- What?

04:02.087 --> 04:03.637
(Juxian Restaurant)

04:11.946 --> 04:12.827
What are you doing?

04:12.827 --> 04:13.987
Are you trying to rob me?

04:15.427 --> 04:18.066
Are you a merchant or a bandit?

04:18.370 --> 04:19.890
Business failed,
but let's keep it civil.

04:25.226 --> 04:26.707
Young Master Wei, you misunderstand.

04:26.906 --> 04:28.427
I'm here to talk business with you.

04:28.867 --> 04:30.626
This is a treasure I've long cherished.

04:30.720 --> 04:31.547
It's a gift for you.

04:39.587 --> 04:40.906
You're here to beg me?

04:40.906 --> 04:41.890
What kind of talk is that?

04:42.946 --> 04:43.827
It's a partnership.

04:45.626 --> 04:46.626
What kind of partnership?

04:46.827 --> 04:47.387
I'm listening.

04:47.827 --> 04:50.466
I can sell your glaze
pieces to foreign lands.

04:50.626 --> 04:52.107
For all the glaze you have these days,

04:52.107 --> 04:54.107
I can offer 3,000 guan as a deposit.

04:54.107 --> 04:55.786
I guarantee that within three months,

04:55.867 --> 04:57.867
I'll sell them
to ten tribal capital cities.

04:58.387 --> 04:59.290
And then I'll give you

05:00.666 --> 05:01.906
thirty percent of the profits.

05:03.320 --> 05:04.990
You're talking to me
with only 3,000 guan?

05:05.986 --> 05:07.747
I didn't bring much money with me.

05:07.866 --> 05:10.306
I need the remaining
5,000 guan to buy grain.

05:11.027 --> 05:12.027
Buy grain?

05:12.866 --> 05:14.986
Selling grain doesn't
make as much as selling glaze.

05:15.226 --> 05:16.306
It's not the same.

05:16.546 --> 05:17.906
The grasslands are
short on grain right now.

05:17.906 --> 05:19.106
This is life-saving money.

05:23.666 --> 05:24.546
8,000 guan.

05:24.747 --> 05:25.546
Then, we'll talk.

05:25.786 --> 05:26.226
My...

05:26.546 --> 05:29.267
My deposit is already
nearly 20 percent of the total.

05:29.306 --> 05:30.866
Who asks for
so much deposit in business?

05:30.866 --> 05:33.346
Glaze pieces are in
high demand in the capital.

05:33.346 --> 05:34.730
There's no worry about selling them.

05:34.747 --> 05:36.346
If you can't even afford 8,000 guan,

05:36.906 --> 05:39.106
which one of us is really the pauper?

05:40.187 --> 05:40.666
I...

05:41.827 --> 05:43.587
I travel the Gobi all year round,

05:43.587 --> 05:44.466
visiting the tribes.

05:44.466 --> 05:46.027
From the Uyghur in the west
to the Tuyuhun in the north,

05:46.027 --> 05:48.106
the nobles of
every tribe are my regulars.

05:48.106 --> 05:48.827
And I'm poor?

05:48.827 --> 05:49.627
8,000 guan.

05:54.187 --> 05:55.666
Not a single guan less.

05:58.106 --> 05:58.906
I won't see you out.

06:00.426 --> 06:01.426
Don't you regret this.

06:02.306 --> 06:03.106
Out of the way!

06:04.680 --> 06:05.627
Imperial Guard business.

06:11.106 --> 06:12.067
What's going on?

06:12.426 --> 06:13.226
What happened?

06:13.466 --> 06:14.947
Why are there so many soldiers here?

06:20.906 --> 06:21.387
Disperse.

06:21.947 --> 06:22.707
We're closed now.

06:23.267 --> 06:26.027
Let's go.

06:30.947 --> 06:32.067
Where is the boss?

06:32.267 --> 06:33.226
Right here.

06:40.426 --> 06:41.306
Officer,

06:41.507 --> 06:42.187
I am the boss.

06:42.986 --> 06:43.866
Is there a problem?

06:44.426 --> 06:45.546
Come with us later.

06:45.700 --> 06:46.986
We are shutting this place down.

06:47.147 --> 06:48.387
This shop is a total scam.

06:48.387 --> 06:50.920
I say you should arrest him now
and interrogate him thoroughly.

06:51.346 --> 06:53.466
Why are you sticking
your nose in everywhere?

06:56.320 --> 06:57.466
Why are you shutting me down?

06:57.466 --> 06:58.290
I haven't broken any laws.

06:58.306 --> 06:59.960
The Imperial Guard
is seizing this place.

07:00.187 --> 07:01.426
Do you have a problem with that?

07:02.707 --> 07:03.507
Take him down.

07:05.306 --> 07:06.106
Nobody move!

07:07.267 --> 07:08.507
Let's see who dares to move.

07:08.747 --> 07:10.267
Who do you think you are?

07:10.346 --> 07:11.627
Shutting us down just like that?

07:12.866 --> 07:14.666
You see my shop making money

07:14.906 --> 07:15.947
and come to rob us?

07:16.187 --> 07:17.627
You've got some nerve.

07:17.780 --> 07:19.387
Don't you recognize the Imperial Guards?

07:21.747 --> 07:23.106
Imperial Guards, so what?

07:23.707 --> 07:25.027
Are there no bad ones among you?

07:25.027 --> 07:26.720
You dare to disrespect
the Imperial Guards?

07:26.747 --> 07:27.990
If you're so tough, come and fight.

07:30.786 --> 07:32.267
(I can't win.)

07:32.270 --> 07:33.600
(They're all armed with swords.)

07:34.106 --> 07:35.666
(What if they hack me to death?)

07:37.660 --> 07:39.226
I have a chair, and you have a sword.

07:39.226 --> 07:40.306
Do you think I'm stupid?

07:40.306 --> 07:41.546
Well, aren't you?

07:42.466 --> 07:43.387
You're scared?

07:43.400 --> 07:44.980
Take me on
one-on-one if you've got guts,

07:45.346 --> 07:46.747
or all of you come at once,

07:46.750 --> 07:47.666
but no weapons allowed.

07:47.666 --> 07:48.387
Do you dare?

07:48.387 --> 07:49.466
We all go at once?

07:49.827 --> 07:50.986
Who are you trying to insult?

07:52.707 --> 07:53.306
Come on.

07:55.267 --> 07:56.267
I won't use a weapon.

07:56.346 --> 07:57.106
Come and fight.

08:00.906 --> 08:01.546
Fine.

08:02.426 --> 08:03.587
But let's get this straight.

08:03.747 --> 08:05.106
If you lose,

08:05.106 --> 08:07.187
the others can't use weapons either.

08:07.267 --> 08:09.747
We're going
to settle this with bare hands.

08:09.786 --> 08:11.027
If I lose,

08:11.226 --> 08:12.387
you can take me away.

08:12.906 --> 08:13.747
I'll have no choice.

08:14.067 --> 08:14.707
Fine.

08:15.306 --> 08:16.986
I promise not to use a weapon.

08:17.067 --> 08:18.986
But if I win,

08:19.426 --> 08:21.387
you're not allowed to shut down my shop,

08:21.387 --> 08:22.466
and not take me away.

08:22.747 --> 08:23.546
Bring it on.

08:24.587 --> 08:25.627
Take this.

08:29.786 --> 08:30.827
You've got some strength.

08:30.827 --> 08:31.507
Get lost.

08:37.346 --> 08:37.906
Insolent.

08:38.306 --> 08:38.827
Stop.

08:41.027 --> 08:41.827
We had a deal.

08:41.986 --> 08:43.306
No weapons.

08:43.546 --> 08:44.747
Your leader said it.

08:47.187 --> 08:47.786
Get him.

08:54.666 --> 08:55.346
So arrogant, huh?

08:55.346 --> 08:56.027
Beat him!

09:00.187 --> 09:01.067
Pin him down!

09:03.600 --> 09:04.466
You dare hit my boss?

09:04.747 --> 09:05.507
I'll kill you.

09:08.027 --> 09:11.466
That's for bullying me. Take that.

09:12.027 --> 09:13.387
You hit me too?

09:14.466 --> 09:15.267
What are you doing?

09:21.387 --> 09:21.906
Let go.

09:22.147 --> 09:23.507
Pull them apart first.

09:35.347 --> 09:36.147
We had a deal.

09:36.706 --> 09:37.946
No retaliatory strikes.

09:38.946 --> 09:40.786
Brat, you'd better behave yourself.

09:42.027 --> 09:42.706
Otherwise,

09:43.347 --> 09:44.186
I'll thrash you.

09:45.267 --> 09:45.706
I...

09:48.306 --> 09:49.467
Such great strength.

09:50.020 --> 09:51.387
It's a pity you're not in the army.

09:51.426 --> 09:53.867
I'm an only child and haven't had
my coming-of-age ceremony.

09:53.867 --> 09:54.730
I can't join the army.

09:54.747 --> 09:55.906
You're just lucky.

09:56.147 --> 09:57.500
If you were born in times of war,

09:57.627 --> 09:58.747
it wouldn't be up to you.

10:03.147 --> 10:05.546
I never thought he'd be
in league with Beicang.

10:07.066 --> 10:07.906
That's perfect.

10:08.227 --> 10:09.186
Take them all away.

10:09.227 --> 10:10.600
What does that have to do with me?

10:10.627 --> 10:11.990
Send them to
the Ministry of Justice prison.

10:12.306 --> 10:12.906
Yes, sir.

10:12.906 --> 10:13.306
Wait.

10:13.706 --> 10:15.227
Is this how you retaliate?

10:17.066 --> 10:17.946
(Juxian Restaurant)
Greetings, Your Highness.

10:18.227 --> 10:19.186
What brings you here?

10:19.906 --> 10:21.627
What's going on with this shop?

10:22.987 --> 10:23.627
Your Highness,

10:23.706 --> 10:24.867
do you want to buy glaze too?

10:24.867 --> 10:25.826
This place has been sealed off.

10:25.826 --> 10:27.306
It was His Majesty's personal order.

10:28.147 --> 10:28.987
Sealed off?

10:30.200 --> 10:31.227
Then, what about Wei Hao?

10:31.227 --> 10:32.747
Who is Wei Hao?

10:33.267 --> 10:34.906
The boss of this shop.

10:34.906 --> 10:35.987
Oh, you mean him?

10:36.347 --> 10:38.347
He injured over a dozen of our men.

10:38.347 --> 10:39.990
He's been taken to
the Ministry of Justice prison.

10:40.706 --> 10:41.627
What?

10:49.625 --> 10:52.455
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

10:53.075 --> 10:56.475
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

10:57.245 --> 11:00.195
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

11:00.535 --> 11:03.235
♪Sigh and walk away♪

11:04.835 --> 11:08.305
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:08.305 --> 11:10.535
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:10.535 --> 11:12.645
♪Colors and darkness♪

11:12.645 --> 11:14.665
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

11:14.665 --> 11:19.025
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

11:20.465 --> 11:24.195
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

11:24.465 --> 11:28.065
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

11:28.225 --> 11:30.305
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

11:30.305 --> 11:35.095
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

11:35.315 --> 11:36.935
♪The world mistakes me♪

11:36.935 --> 11:39.275
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

11:39.345 --> 11:40.535
♪As the storm approaches♪

11:40.535 --> 11:42.935
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

11:43.145 --> 11:44.865
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

11:44.865 --> 11:46.845
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

11:47.015 --> 11:48.765
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

11:48.765 --> 11:50.865
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

11:50.865 --> 11:52.335
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

11:52.335 --> 11:54.565
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

11:54.785 --> 11:55.985
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

11:55.985 --> 11:58.505
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

11:58.635 --> 12:00.345
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

12:00.345 --> 12:01.625
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

12:01.775 --> 12:03.195
♪My wish has finally come true♪

12:03.195 --> 12:04.235
♪To stay by your side♪

12:04.235 --> 12:06.155
♪In this fleeting world♪

12:06.325 --> 12:09.575
♪We are free and happy♪

12:13.575 --> 12:15.355
♪From a nobody♪

12:15.355 --> 12:17.255
♪To someone now famous♪

12:17.365 --> 12:18.795
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

12:18.795 --> 12:21.305
♪But I laugh at how they
cannot see through it all♪

12:21.405 --> 12:22.985
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

12:22.985 --> 12:25.055
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

12:25.265 --> 12:26.945
♪In this vast world♪

12:26.945 --> 12:28.945
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

12:29.095 --> 12:31.305
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

12:31.305 --> 12:32.895
♪Everything ends eventually♪

12:32.985 --> 12:34.485
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

12:34.485 --> 12:36.885
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

12:36.885 --> 12:38.595
♪No matter how time flies♪

12:38.595 --> 12:39.755
♪Even if the falling snow♪

12:39.755 --> 12:41.385
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

12:41.385 --> 12:42.425
♪All I want now♪

12:42.425 --> 12:44.525
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

12:44.525 --> 12:47.785
♪Year after year♪
